Error [jet.LibraryEffectParentInvalid]: The parent `FS` of `Audit` is no open effect
  --> tests/ui/effects/package_effect_parent_family_is_e0758.jet:3:17
    |
  3 |         parent: FS
    |                 ^^
 Why: A package effect is a kind of an open effect, a struct; an enum family such as `FS` or `DB` is already cut into its own cases, and `Panic` and `Mem` are only denied
 Fix: Make `Audit` a kind of an open effect such as `Log`, or write the family's case in the rows that need it (`-[FS.Read]>`)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0758
